       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CICUP9.
      * CREDIT BUREAU CORRECTION AFTER DUES SETTLEMENT
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-SETTLED-AGE            PIC 9(4) VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-UNDER-DISPUTE          PIC X(1) VALUE 'N'.
       01  WS-BUREAU-ACTION          PIC X(8) VALUE SPACES.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       1000-MAIN.
           ACCEPT WS-SETTLED-AGE
           ACCEPT WS-UNDER-DISPUTE
           PERFORM 2000-BUREAU
           DISPLAY 'BUREAU: ' WS-BUREAU-ACTION
           STOP RUN.
       2000-BUREAU.
           IF WS-UNDER-DISPUTE = 'Y'
              MOVE 'HOLD' TO WS-BUREAU-ACTION
           ELSE
              IF WS-SETTLED-AGE > 30
                 MOVE 'BREACH' TO WS-BUREAU-ACTION
              ELSE
                 MOVE 'CORRECT' TO WS-BUREAU-ACTION
              END-IF
           END-IF.
